### ===================================================================
### Airport Taxi Ride Offers Platform - Scenario 1 & 2 Demo
### Menon Family (Traveler) & Sakura Cabs (Supplier) End-to-End Workflow
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. TRAVELER FLOW (M1, R1, R2, R3)
### Post Ride Request: Menon family landing at Narita (NRT), Hotel Ueno Garden Inn
### 2 adults, 1 child (age 6), 3 large bags, 2 small bags, pickup 11:30, price ₹12,000
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createMenonRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/traveler/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "traveler_name": "Menon family",
  "flight_id": "FL-401",
  "hotel_id": "HTL-TYO-004",
  "adults": 2,
  "child_ages": [6],
  "large_bags": 3,
  "small_bags": 2,
  "pickup": "2027-04-10T11:30:00",
  "car_type": null,
  "price_inr": 12000
}

### Store the created requestId from response above (e.g. REQ-XXXX)
@requestId = {{createMenonRequest.response.body.request_id}}

### View the posted ride request
GET {{baseUrl}}/traveler/requests/{{requestId}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. SUPPLIER FLOW (M2, R4)
### Sakura Cabs (TX-JP-01) checks open requests dashboard
### Verified: Serves NRT, drives to Tokyo/Ueno, open at 11:30, car SC-3 fits & is free
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/TX-JP-01/open-requests

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. SUPPLIER ERROR CASE A (M3, R5 Violation)
### Sakura Cabs assigns vehicle SC-1 (SEDAN with only 2 large bags capacity)
### EXPECTED: 400 Bad Request with rule "R5" - Vehicle capacity violation
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "request_id": "{{requestId}}",
  "company_id": "TX-JP-01",
  "vehicle_id": "SC-1",
  "offered_price_inr": 12000
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. SUPPLIER ERROR CASE B (M3, R7 Violation)
### Sakura Cabs assigns vehicle SC-3 with price ₹20,000 (Outside route range ₹10,200 - ₹16,800)
### EXPECTED: 400 Bad Request with rule "R7" - Price range violation
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "request_id": "{{requestId}}",
  "company_id": "TX-JP-01",
  "vehicle_id": "SC-3",
  "offered_price_inr": 20000
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. SUPPLIER VALID OFFER A (M3, R7)
### Sakura Cabs assigns vehicle SC-3 (SUV, fits 6 seats & 4 large bags) at ₹12,500
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name submitSakuraOffer
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "request_id": "{{requestId}}",
  "company_id": "TX-JP-01",
  "vehicle_id": "SC-3",
  "offered_price_inr": 12500
}

@sakuraOfferId = {{submitSakuraOffer.response.body.id}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. SECOND SUPPLIER OFFER B (M3)
### Edo Premium Cars (TX-JP-03) assigns vehicle EP-3 at ₹14,000
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name submitEdoOffer
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "request_id": "{{requestId}}",
  "company_id": "TX-JP-03",
  "vehicle_id": "EP-3",
  "offered_price_inr": 14000
}

@edoOfferId = {{submitEdoOffer.response.body.id}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. TRAVELER VIEWS OFFERS (M4)
### Traveler sees taxis from both suppliers with car details and prices
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/traveler/requests/{{requestId}}/offers

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. TRAVELER REJECTS OFFER (R8)
### Traveler rejects Edo Premium Cars offer
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/traveler/offers/{{edoOfferId}}/reject

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. TRAVELER BOOKS SAKURA CABS OFFER (M4, M6, R8)
### Overlap check executed atomically in O(log N). Generates 10-digit booking number.
### Other offers transition to NOT_CHOSEN.
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name bookSakuraOffer
POST {{baseUrl}}/traveler/offers/{{sakuraOfferId}}/book

@bookingNumber = {{bookSakuraOffer.response.body.booking_number}}
@bookingId = {{bookSakuraOffer.response.body.id}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. BOOKING SUMMARY LOOKUP (M5)
### Retrieve booking summary via the 10-digit booking number
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/by-number/{{bookingNumber}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. TRAVELER CHANGE REQUEST (M7, R9)
### Traveler submits change request for later pickup: 2027-04-10T12:00:00
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name submitChangeReq
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/change-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "new_pickup_time": "2027-04-10T12:00:00"
}

@changeRequestId = {{submitChangeReq.response.body.id}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. SUPPLIER VIEWS PENDING CHANGE REQUESTS (M7)
### Sakura Cabs reviews pending change requests for their bookings
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/TX-JP-01/change-requests

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. SUPPLIER ACCEPTS CHANGE REQUEST (M7, R9)
### Overlap query checks availability excluding current bookingId.
### Recalculates busy interval (12:00 to 15:00).
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/change-requests/{{changeRequestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. VERIFY UPDATED BOOKING SUMMARY (M5, M7)
### Confirm pickup updated to 12:00 and busyEndTime updated to 15:00
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/by-number/{{bookingNumber}}

